## Development

### Setup

```bash
# Install with dev dependencies
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
pytest

# Run linters
ruff check .
mypy tux_wallpaper/

# Format code
ruff format .
isort .
```

### Testing

```bash
# Run all tests with coverage
pytest --cov=tux_wallpaper --cov-report=term-missing

# Run specific test suite
pytest tests/unit/
pytest tests/integration/
```

